---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {techProjects} from '../data/tech-projects';
import ProjectCard from '../components/TechProjectCard.astro';
import Ecosystem from '../components/TechEcosystem.astro';
import TechEducation from '../components/TechEducation.astro';
const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/`;
---
<Layout title="ICY TECH — Chad Hamilton / Interconnected Technical Systems" description="Independent engineering across creative computation, AI, automation, security and infrastructure. Real implementations, evidence and honest limits.">
  <section class="tech-shell tech-hero" id="work">
    <p class="tech-eyebrow">Chad Hamilton · Independent engineering · Dallas–Fort Worth</p>
    <h1>I build real,<br /><em>interconnected</em><br />technical systems.</h1>
    <p class="tech-lead">Creative tools with editable internals. AI with evidence boundaries. Automation that knows when to stop. Infrastructure built to recover.</p>
    <div class="tech-linkrow"><a class="tech-button" href={`${base}projects/`}>Explore the work ↗</a><a href={`${base}software/`}>Software / AI</a><a href={`${base}security/`}>Security</a><a href={`${base}systems/`}>Systems / IT</a></div>
    <div class="tech-metrics"><div><strong>Build</strong><span>Applications → services → instruments</span></div><div><strong>Connect</strong><span>Media, models, data and workflows</span></div><div><strong>Verify</strong><span>Source, test receipts and explicit limits</span></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="tech-section tech-shell" aria-labelledby="flagship-heading">
    <p class="tech-eyebrow">Selected engineering / freshly audited November 10, 2026</p><h2 id="flagship-heading">Not isolated demos.<br />Working parts of a larger practice.</h2>
    <p class="tech-lead">The strongest current candidates—not a repeat of the previous resume shortlist. Each case separates implemented functionality, retained verification and what still needs proving.</p>
    <div class="tech-grid">{techProjects.slice(0,6).map(project => <ProjectCard project={project} />)}</div>
    <p class="tech-linkrow"><a href={`${base}projects/`}>Explore all {techProjects.length} detailed cases →</a><a href={`${base}evidence/`}>Ranking and evidence standard →</a></p>
  </section>
  <section class="tech-section tech-shell" id="approach"><p class="tech-eyebrow">Engineering judgment</p><h2>Make complexity legible.<br />Keep authority bounded.</h2><div class="tech-grid"><article class="tech-card"><h3>Editable, not disposable</h3><p>Scenes, media decisions and investigations remain structured and revisable. A useful system survives its first impressive output.</p></article><article class="tech-card"><h3>Evidence, not theater</h3><p>Actual inference is not a mocked model. A private upload is not a publish-button test. A numerical comparison is not phone-sensor acceptance.</p></article><article class="tech-card"><h3>Recoverable by design</h3><p>Originals, derived state, permissions and replay are separate concerns. The interesting work lives at those boundaries.</p></article></div></section>
  <TechEducation />
  <section class="tech-section tech-shell"><Ecosystem /></section>
  <section class="tech-section tech-shell" id="about"><p class="tech-eyebrow">The person behind the systems</p><h2>Technical depth.<br />An experimental point of view.</h2><p class="tech-lead">I’m Chad Hamilton. My independent work connects software engineering with creative practice, scientific tooling and local infrastructure. I build with coding agents and established libraries; these cases focus on implementation, integration and verification decisions I can substantiate.</p><p>My background includes customer-facing technical troubleshooting and a field IT internship. My cybersecurity and computer networking A.A.S. coursework is in progress. Independent projects are not presented as employment, production security certification or established scientific findings.</p><div class="tech-linkrow"><a class="tech-button" href="mailto:Justchadham@gmail.com">Let’s talk</a><a href="https://github.com/icyNatural">Public GitHub profile ↗</a><a href="https://icyclearer.com">Creative practice ↗</a></div><p class="tech-muted">One technical site. Three career entry points. The creative website remains separate.</p></section>
</Layout>